@page "/"

<PageTitle>AgentBlazor Demo</PageTitle>

<section class="home-halo">
    <div class="home-halo__hero">
        <div class="home-halo__brand">AB</div>
        <p class="home-halo__eyebrow">AgentBlazor Demo</p>
        <h1>The AI layer for your existing Blazor UI.</h1>
        <p>
            Describe what you need. The demo routes you to the right screen and starts with the right state,
            including supplier risk filters.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="home-halo__highlights">
        <article>
            <h2>Natural Prompt Routing</h2>
            <p>Ask for high-risk suppliers, onboarding, or workspace views from one prompt bar.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
            <h2>Agent-Ready Components</h2>
            <p>AgentDataGrid, AgentForm, AgentDialog, AgentNavMenu, and AgentTabs are wired and discoverable.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
            <h2>Deterministic Demo Flow</h2>
            <p>Prompt from home, navigate instantly, and show the exact page state your request implies.</p>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<HomePromptBar />
